+"""Bounded inert OPC/BIFF12 XLSB reader; no filesystem or external execution.
+
+MS-XLSB v22: §§2.1.4, 2.4.316, 2.4.319-330, 2.4.684-687,
+2.4.770, 2.5.10, 2.5.98.4, 2.5.122-123 and 2.5.167-169.
+Only explicitly recognized records/parts are accepted. Layout/style payloads are
+not interpreted; formulas are limited to local arithmetic/literal/reference and
+SUM token forms, and only their stored caches are emitted, never evaluated.
